N5008 [over.ics.rank]/4.4.4: nonmember_operator_is_better compares the ranks
of implicit_conversion_sequence, which are equal for derived-to-base
reference bindings to bases at different distances, so the member is kept.
g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
